 2135: // /**
 2136: //    For a point (x1,y1) inside the element and a line segment (x1,y1)-(x2,y2), find the intersection point 
 2137: //    (xIntersect,yIntersect) and the side (intersectingSide) that it intersects.
 2138: 
 2139: //    Inputs:
 2140: //    @param x1, y1: point inside the element
 2141: //    @param x2, y2: other end of the line segment
 2142: 
 2143: //    Outputs:
